### Create process
POST http://localhost:8080/api/processes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Adressänderung",
  "description": "Neue Adresse eines Mitglieds bearbeiten",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Get all processes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/processes

### Get process by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/processes/6a7ba2b1ca059caa764199b7

### Get non-existing process
GET http://localhost:8080/api/processes/does-not-exist

### Start processing
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/processes/6a7ba2b1ca059caa764199b7/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Complete process
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/processes/6a7ba2b1ca059caa764199b7/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### Try to reopen completed process
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/processes/6a7bbfc22f36e95e15b7f57c/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Delete process
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/processes/6a7c67d3c8b492e6afc6fb83

### Edit process
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/processes/6a7bbfc22f36e95e15b7f57c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "In Bearbeitung",
  "description": "Neue Prozess wird bearbeitet",
  "assignedEmployeeId": "123",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}